- workingDir: /tmp/skyscanner-app
- files: ["/tmp/skyscanner-app/docs/api-contract.md"]
- requiredSkills: ["api-discovery","curl","rapidapi"]
- dependsOn: ["SKY-001"]
- notes: RAPIDAPI_KEY is available in the environment. Known candidate host: skyscanner.p.rapidapi.com (429 responses confirm subscription active). sky-scanner3.p.rapidapi.com returns 404 — do not use it. Probe with curl -si to inspect both status codes and response bodies. A 429 (Too Many Requests) on an endpoint confirms the path is valid — document it. The goal is an accurate contract doc, not a working implementation.

